config LINUX_BLUEZ_PROFILE
	tristate "BlueZ remaining profile-shaped closeout adapter"
	default y
	depends on LINUX_BLUEZ_PORT
	---help---
		Enable bluezprofile, a profile-shaped closeout adapter for the
		remaining profile families that still need independent hwsim
		evidence: Mesh, ASHA, MIDI, Ranging, Print, and iAP.  This keeps
		the closeout surface explicit while the compatibility glue is
		gradually replaced with more direct upstream BlueZ ownership.

if LINUX_BLUEZ_PROFILE

