	tristate "BlueZ A2DP Profile-shaped closeout adapter"
	default y
	depends on LINUX_BLUEZ_PORT
	---help---
		Enable blueza2dp, an A2DP profile closeout adapter that keeps
		AVDTP signaling, media bearer, MediaTransport ownership, SBC
		codec policy, stream lifecycle, cleanup, and upstream source
		coverage in one hwsim-verifiable command.

